```mermaid
graph TB
    Start[Need to pick<br/>activation function] --> Q1{Hidden or<br/>Output Layer?}
    
    Q1 -->|Hidden| Q2{Modern<br/>architecture?}
    Q2 -->|Yes, default| ReLU[ReLU<br/>max 0, z]
    Q2 -->|Dying ReLU?| LeakyReLU[Leaky ReLU<br/>max 0.01·z, z]
    Q2 -->|RNN/LSTM| Tanh[Tanh<br/>-1 to 1]
    Q2 -->|Transformer| GELU[GELU<br/>modern variant]
    
    Q1 -->|Output| Q3{What kind<br/>of prediction?}
    Q3 -->|Binary 0 or 1| Sigmoid[Sigmoid<br/>1/1+e⁻ᶻ]
    Q3 -->|Multi-class| Softmax[Softmax<br/>probabilities sum to 1]
    Q3 -->|Real number| Linear[Linear<br/>no activation]
    Q3 -->|Probability| Sigmoid2[Sigmoid<br/>output in 0,1]
    
    ReLU --> Done([Use this])
    LeakyReLU --> Done
    Tanh --> Done
    GELU --> Done
    Sigmoid --> Done
    Softmax --> Done
    Linear --> Done
    Sigmoid2 --> Done
    
    style ReLU fill:#c8e6c9
    style Sigmoid fill:#fff9c4
    style Softmax fill:#bbdefb
    style Linear fill:#f8bbd0
```
